344 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 172 0 R
/E (Target quality: Even with well-converged search candidates, if the target moments themselves were generated from under trained agents, the discrimination signal was absent. A social tradeoff agent trained to 160 episodes with high epsilon gives near random dictator allocations. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
345 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 762 0 R
/E (Raising target generation to 500 episodes with greedy tail scoring worked in the sense that the target moments now genuinely reflected social preferences. )
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5]
>>
